@startuml
title State Diagram: Goal Lifecycle

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12

[*] --> Created
Created --> InProgress : Goal activated
InProgress --> OnTrack : Milestones met
InProgress --> AtRisk : Missed targets repeatedly
OnTrack --> Achieved : Target reached
OnTrack --> AtRisk : Progress drops
AtRisk --> Adjusted : System / user revises goal
Adjusted --> InProgress : New target confirmed
InProgress --> Failed : Deadline reached\nwithout achievement
AtRisk --> Failed : Deadline reached\nwithout achievement
Achieved --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Created
Goal is defined with:
- target metric
- target value
- deadline
- priority
end note

note right of AtRisk
Examples:
- low adherence score
- repeated calorie deviation
- missed workout frequency
end note
@enduml
